#: model:ir.model.fields,help:planning.field_hr_employee__planning_role_ids
msgid ""
"Roles that the employee can fill in. When creating a shift for this "
"employee, only the shift templates for these roles will be displayed.\n"
"Similarly, only the open shifts available for these roles will be sent to "
"the employee when the schedule is published.\n"
"Additionally, the employee will only be assigned orders for these roles "
"(with the default planning role having precedence over the other ones).\n"
"Leave empty for the employee to be assigned shifts regardless of the role."
msgstr ""
"Roller, som medarbejderen kan varetage. Når du opretter et vagtskema for "
"denne medarbejder, vises kun skabeloner for disse roller.\n"
"Når vagtplanen offentliggøres, sendes kun ledige vagter, der matcher disse "
"roller, til medarbejderen.\n"
"Medarbejderen tildeles kun vagter inden for disse roller (hvor "
"standardplanlægningsfunktionen har forrang over øvrige roller).\n"
"Lad feltet stå tomt, hvis medarbejderen kan tildeles vagter uafhængigt af "
"rolle."

